OL,3,GNEWSAThe rides not to miss at this
OL,4,Ayear's Goose Fair
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of people will soon descend
OL,7,Fon Nottingham's famous Goose Fair
OL,8,Fhoping to enjoy an exhilarating ride,
OL,9,Fdose up on sweet treats or win a cuddly
OL,10,Fcrocodile.
OL,12,FThe fair, which dates back more than
OL,13,F700 years, returned to the Forest
OL,14,FRecreation Ground in Nottingham on
OL,15,FFriday and will run until 4 October.
OL,17,FA bumper event will bring more than 400
OL,18,Fattractions to the fairground in 2026
OL,19,Facross 10 days, including the tallest
OL,20,Fride ever to attend Goose Fair.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
